---
import { type ServicesProps } from '../../types/components';

interface Props extends ServicesProps {}
const { id = "services" } = Astro.props;
---

<section id={id} class="bg-slate-900 text-white py-12 lg:py-24" data-analytics-id="pricing">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Phase 1 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-800 p-8 rounded-sm border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 transition-colors">
        <div class="text-slate-400 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Phase 1</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">Phase 1 – Public-Record Forensic Diagnostic <span class="text-base font-normal text-slate-400 block mt-1">(No NDA Required)</span></h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Documentary technical screening based solely on publicly available information: environmental filings, interconnection records, permitting documentation, public technical disclosures, climate exposure, and jurisdiction-specific public records.
          <br/><br/>
          <span class="text-slate-400 italic">All work is remote. Value delivered via written technical gating report.</span>
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-300 text-sm">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Binary technical gate: GO / CONDITIONAL NO-GO / NO-GO
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Bankability Index and evidence-grade assessment
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Critical Silence detection across technical, contractual, regulatory, and safety dimensions
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Phase 2 clarification scope for deeper diligence if warranted
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 2 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-800 p-8 rounded-sm border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 transition-colors">
        <div class="text-slate-400 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Phase 2</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">Phase 2 – Clarification & Deeper Review Scope</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          If Phase 1 does not justify an outright halt, BiP Omega defines a second-stage scope based on the exact gaps, assumptions, and technical uncertainties identified in the initial diagnostic.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-300 text-sm">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Specific technical evidence requests
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Targeted clarification priorities
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Separate mandate for any deeper review
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
